{"seq":2,"slug":"agent-state-persistence-recovery","title":"运行时状态持久化与故障恢复","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/agentic-ai-engineering-systems/agent-runtime-systems/agent-state-persistence-recovery","wordCount":2567,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"运行时状态持久化与故障恢复\">运行时状态持久化与故障恢复</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>检查点（checkpoint）</strong>：在循环的某个可识别位置，把「此刻的全部状态」序列化落盘，使进程可以从该点重放。</li>\n<li><strong>持久执行（durable execution）</strong>：把长流程的每一步结果写入持久日志，进程崩溃后按日志重建内存状态并继续，而不是从头再跑。</li>\n<li><strong>事件溯源（event sourcing）</strong>：只存「发生了什么」（事件），不存「现在是什么」（快照），当前状态由事件序列确定性重放得出。</li>\n<li><strong>重放确定性（replay determinism）</strong>：同一条事件序列重放必须得到同一个状态；一旦代码里有随机数、当前时间、非确定性遍历，重放就会分叉。</li>\n<li><strong>幂等键（idempotency key）</strong>：写操作的去重标识，保证重试不重复产生副作用。与 <a href=\"../agent-core-architecture/agent-memory-context-state\">智能体记忆、上下文与状态管理</a> 中定义的是同一个概念。</li>\n<li><strong>崩溃恢复窗口（recovery window）</strong>：崩溃发生到恢复完成之间，外部世界可能已经改变的幅度；它决定恢复逻辑要做多少对账。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"为什么长任务-agent-必须先解决持久化\">为什么长任务 agent 必须先解决持久化</h2><p>一个跑了四十步工具调用、正准备把报关单提交给海关系统的 agent，进程被杀掉了。此时内存里的状态——已归类的 HS 编码、已核验的原产地规则、已生成待提交的单证草稿——全部蒸发。如果没有外置持久化，重启后只有两个选择：从头再跑一遍（重复调用外部接口、重复产生费用、对外部世界重复施压），或者放弃。</p>\n<p>这不是边缘情况。平台会重新调度 Pod、会滚动升级、会因内存超限触发 OOM Kill；长任务 agent 的步数分布是长尾的，单次运行跨越分钟到小时量级。Anthropic 把这种「步数不可预判」列为主题本身适合 agent 循环的判据（<a href=\"https://www.anthropic.com/engineering/building-effective-agents\">Building Effective Agents</a>），而步数不可预判恰恰意味着<strong>你不能假设运行总会一次跑完</strong>。持久化不是容错的可选加分项，是长任务 agent 能否上线的前提。</p>\n<p>工程上要区分两类状态，混为一谈是常见设计错误：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>状态类别</th>\n<th>例子</th>\n<th>权威来源</th>\n<th>持久化策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>执行状态</td>\n<td>当前在第几步、下一步调用哪个工具、待处理队列</td>\n<td>agent 运行时自己</td>\n<td>事件日志 / 检查点，运行时独占写入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>业务状态</td>\n<td>订单是否已发货、报关单是否已提交</td>\n<td>对应的业务服务数据库</td>\n<td>只读引用；agent 不得私自缓存为权威</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>《12-Factor Agents》的 Factor 5 把这条命名为「unify execution state and business state」——把执行状态与业务状态放在<strong>同一处</strong>管理，让 agent 成为可重放的状态归约器（<a href=\"https://github.com/humanlayer/12-factor-agents\">12-Factor Agents</a>）。它的反面是把执行状态塞在内存、把业务状态散落在五个微服务里，崩溃后两边对不上且无人知晓。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三种持久化边界-会话级-步骤级-事件级\">三种持久化边界：会话级、步骤级、事件级</h2><p>按「多久落一次盘、落什么」切分，生产系统落在三个不同粒度上，成本与恢复能力成反比。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    Start[agent 循环开始] --&gt; Step[执行一步: 推理 + 工具调用]&#10;    Step --&gt; CK{落盘粒度?}&#10;    CK --&gt;|会话级| S1[仅在会话结束写快照]&#10;    CK --&gt;|步骤级| S2[每步写一条检查点]&#10;    CK --&gt;|事件级| S3[每次状态变更追加事件]&#10;    S1 --&gt; Crash{进程崩溃?}&#10;    S2 --&gt; Crash&#10;    S3 --&gt; Crash&#10;    Crash --&gt;|未崩溃| Step&#10;    Crash --&gt;|崩溃| Recover[加载最近持久点]&#10;    Recover --&gt; Replay[确定性重放后续事件]&#10;    Replay --&gt; Reconcile[对外部副作用做幂等对账]&#10;    Reconcile --&gt; Step\">flowchart TD\n    Start[agent 循环开始] --&gt; Step[执行一步: 推理 + 工具调用]\n    Step --&gt; CK{落盘粒度?}\n    CK --&gt;|会话级| S1[仅在会话结束写快照]\n    CK --&gt;|步骤级| S2[每步写一条检查点]\n    CK --&gt;|事件级| S3[每次状态变更追加事件]\n    S1 --&gt; Crash{进程崩溃?}\n    S2 --&gt; Crash\n    S3 --&gt; Crash\n    Crash --&gt;|未崩溃| Step\n    Crash --&gt;|崩溃| Recover[加载最近持久点]\n    Recover --&gt; Replay[确定性重放后续事件]\n    Replay --&gt; Reconcile[对外部副作用做幂等对账]\n    Reconcile --&gt; Step</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>会话级</strong>：只在对话结束或显式 <code>save</code> 时写一次。实现最省事，OpenAI Agents SDK 的 sessions 就属于这一层——它在 agent 循环内维护工作上下文，后端可挂 SQLite、Redis，但默认语义是「会话记忆」，不是「崩溃即恢复」（<a href=\"https://openai.github.io/openai-agents-python/\">OpenAI Agents SDK</a>）。适合单次不可中断的短任务。</li>\n<li><strong>步骤级</strong>：循环每推进一步就写一条检查点，崩溃后从最后一条恢复。语言图框架把它做成显式对象——LangGraph 的 checkpointer 在每一步之后保存图状态，并用 <code>thread_id</code> 关联同一条执行线，支持「时间旅行」到任意历史检查点（<a href=\"https://langchain-ai.github.io/langgraph/concepts/persistence/\">LangGraph Persistence</a>）。这是绝大多数 agent 的合理默认。</li>\n<li><strong>事件级</strong>：不存快照，只追加事件流，状态由重放得出。Temporal 的 Workflow 走的就是这条路——事件历史（Event History）是唯一真相源，Worker 崩溃后由另一个 Worker 拉取历史、重放代码、恢复到崩溃点（<a href=\"https://docs.temporal.io/\">Temporal 文档</a>）。恢复粒度最细、审计性最强，代价是写放大和严格的重放确定性约束。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>设一次运行的步骤数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>、每步状态大小为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span>、落盘频率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span>（步/次），则写放大为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌈</mo><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌉</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W = \\lceil n/f \\rceil \\cdot s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌉</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span>，崩溃时最坏需要重放的步数上界是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{\\max} = f - 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>。这是持久化的基本权衡：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>↑</mo><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>↓</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W \\uparrow \\Rightarrow R_{\\max} \\downarrow</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↑⇒</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↓</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>事件级取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{\\max}=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>（无重放，纯重建），但写放大最大；会话级取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f=n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>，写放大最小，但崩溃最坏丢掉整段运行。选择的判据是<strong>重放一步的边际成本</strong>——重放一步只是读内存，可以粗粒度；重放一步要重新调用付费的外部 API，就必须细粒度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"重放确定性-持久执行最难的一关\">重放确定性：持久执行最难的一关</h2><p>事件溯源要求重放同一序列得到同一状态，但 agent 代码天然充满非确定源：<code>now()</code>、<code>random()</code>、UUID 生成、<code>set</code> 遍历顺序、并行 future 的完成顺序、以及最要命的——LLM 采样。Temporal 的硬性规则是：Workflow 代码里不允许直接读系统时钟或生成随机数，必须通过 <code>Workflow.now()</code>、<code>Workflow.random()</code> 这类由框架在重放时返回<strong>原记录值</strong>的 API 获取（<a href=\"https://docs.temporal.io/\">Temporal 文档</a>）。</p>\n<p>对 agent 而言，LLM 调用必须被记录为<strong>副作用事件</strong>而非在重放时重新发起。做法有两类：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>记录即真相</strong>：首次执行时把模型的完整响应（或工具返回值）写进事件日志；重放时直接读出该事件，不再调用模型。这保证重放零成本、零费用，也是唯一能保证重放确定的方式。</li>\n<li><strong>可重放但需对账</strong>：重放时确实重新调用，再用幂等键去重。只在副作用天然幂等、或外部接口支持幂等键时才可行。</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>replay</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi><mtext> </mtext><mtext>重放次数</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{replay}(e_1, e_2, \\dots, e_k) = S_k \\quad \\forall\\, \\text{重放次数}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">replay</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">重放次数</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>公式表达的就是不变式：同一前缀的任何一次重放都收敛到同一个状态 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。任何违反它的代码路径（读墙上时钟、未记录的工具调用）在崩溃恢复时都会产出一个<strong>看起来正常但实际分歧</strong>的状态——这是持久化最隐蔽的故障模式，因为它不报错。</p>\n<h2 id=\"副作用与幂等-恢复窗口里的对账\">副作用与幂等：恢复窗口里的对账</h2><p>崩溃恢复窗口是问题的核心：agent 在第 30 步调用「提交报关单」成功，第 31 步写检查点之前进程死了。恢复后，日志显示第 30 步未完成。此时：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>无脑重试 → 报关单重复提交，可能触发海关系统的重复申报告警甚至处罚。</li>\n<li>放弃 → 单证实际已提交，但 agent 认为自己没提交，状态与事实源分叉。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>正确做法是给每个<strong>对外部的写操作</strong>配一个幂等键，让外部系统自身去重，恢复时携带同一幂等键重试。支付、下单、发消息、提交申报这类接口在 2026 年的主流实现都接受幂等键（Stripe 的 <code>Idempotency-Key</code> 头是常被引用的范例）；对不支持的接口，用一个<strong>两阶段登记</strong>兜底：先写「意图事件」（我刚要调用 X，键为 K），再调用，再写「完成事件」。恢复时读到「有意图无完成」，就去外部系统按 K 查询实际状态再决定继续或补偿——即「先查后做」（query-before-act）。</p>\n<p>《12-Factor Agents》的 Factor 8「Own your control flow」在这里有直接含义：控制流归自己，你才能把「记录意图」和「执行动作」拆成两个可恢复的原子。把控制流交给一个不透明的框架，这两拍就捏在一起，恢复窗口内的对账就无从下手。</p>\n<p>代价是延迟：先查后做让每个写操作多一次往返。设外部调用单次成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>、对账查询成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span>、崩溃概率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>，则对账策略的期望成本约为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>cost</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>recover</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E[\\text{cost}] = c + p \\cdot (q + c_{\\text{recover}})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cost</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">recover</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 很小时看似不值，但对报关、结算这类「重复一次就是真金白银」的操作，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>recover</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{\\text{recover}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">recover</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（重复申报的代价）远大于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span>，此时对账是必然选择。</p>\n<h2 id=\"落地清单\">落地清单</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>选粒度</strong>：先问「重放一步的成本是多少」，据此在会话级 / 步骤级 / 事件级里选。绝大多数 agent 从步骤级起步。</li>\n<li><strong>隔离非确定源</strong>：时钟、随机、UUID、并行顺序全部走框架提供的可重放 API 或显式记录。代码评审时把「直接调用系统时间」当作阻断项。</li>\n<li><strong>给所有外部写操作配幂等键</strong>，不支持的地方用意图/完成两阶段事件 + 先查后做。</li>\n<li><strong>区分执行状态与业务状态</strong>：业务事实永远从业务服务读，agent 存的是引用不是副本。</li>\n<li><strong>验证恢复路径本身</strong>：恢复逻辑要有测试——注入一次崩溃、断言恢复后状态一致且外部副作用未重复。没测过的恢复路径等于没有。</li>\n<li><strong>记录恢复事件</strong>：每次恢复都应写一条可审计的日志，标明从哪个检查点恢复、对账了哪些外部操作。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>运行时状态持久化的本质是把「无状态进程里的长流程」翻译成「有状态日志上的确定性重放」。三个粒度（会话 / 步骤 / 事件）对应写放大与重放成本的不同权衡；持久执行的真正难点不是落盘，而是<strong>重放确定性</strong>与<strong>副作用对账</strong>——前者要求把所有非确定源收进可重放 API，后者要求所有外部写操作幂等化并用先查后做兜底。把这两件事做对，agent 就能在崩溃、滚动升级、超时重调度之间保持一致；做不对，恢复出来的会是一个静默分歧的状态，比直接崩溃更危险。循环状态如何建模与分层，见 <a href=\"../agent-core-architecture/agent-memory-context-state\">智能体记忆、上下文与状态管理</a>；循环本身的结构见 <a href=\"../agent-core-architecture/agent-loop-reasoning-architecture\">智能体循环与推理架构</a>；多 agent 之间的状态传递与协调见 <a href=\"../agent-orchestration-coordination/multi-agent-topology-patterns\">多智能体拓扑模式</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"运行时状态持久化与故障恢复","id":"运行时状态持久化与故障恢复"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么长任务 agent 必须先解决持久化","id":"为什么长任务-agent-必须先解决持久化"},{"level":2,"text":"三种持久化边界：会话级、步骤级、事件级","id":"三种持久化边界-会话级-步骤级-事件级"},{"level":2,"text":"重放确定性：持久执行最难的一关","id":"重放确定性-持久执行最难的一关"},{"level":2,"text":"副作用与幂等：恢复窗口里的对账","id":"副作用与幂等-恢复窗口里的对账"},{"level":2,"text":"落地清单","id":"落地清单"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"智能体沙箱与代码执行安全","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/agentic-ai-engineering-systems/agent-runtime-systems/agent-sandbox-execution-safety"},"next":{"title":"可观测性、追踪与成本/延迟治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/agentic-ai-engineering-systems/agent-runtime-systems/agent-observability-tracing-cost"}}